WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.274
Tabular data underpins applications like stock
prediction, real-estate forecasting,

00:00:05.354 --> 00:00:06.499
and credit scoring.

00:00:06.579 --> 00:00:11.015
Yet unlike text and images, it has no widely
adopted foundation model.

00:00:11.095 --> 00:00:16.111
The reason: tables come in endless schemas,
different column names, data types,

00:00:16.191 --> 00:00:20.368
and counts, so a model trained on one cannot be
reused on another.

00:00:20.448 --> 00:00:25.206
Existing methods either flatten tables into text,
losing numerical meaning,

00:00:25.286 --> 00:00:28.366
or assume train and test share a fixed structure.

00:00:28.446 --> 00:00:31.140
Both block knowledge transfer across tasks.
